{"code":0,"data":{"title":"APP核准（备案）授权函上传","content":"<h2 id=\"s-720onqaw\">app.upload.icp.auth.letter</h2><p>功能描述：游戏更新核准（备案）文件上传</p><p></p><h2 id=\"s-zxsyai0d\">环境信息</h2><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\"><p><strong>环境</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"409\" style=\"width: 409px\"><p><strong>HTTPS地址</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"174\" style=\"width: 174px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>正式环境</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"409\" style=\"width: 409px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>https://developer-api.vivo.com.cn/router/rest</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><h2 id=\"s-jda3oro4\">公共参数</h2><p>调用任何一个API都必须传入的参数，目前支持的公共参数有：</p><table class=\"edit-table\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\"><p><strong>参数名称</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\"><p><strong>参数类型</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\"><p><strong>是否必须</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"582\" style=\"width: 582px\"><p><strong>参数描述</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"582\" style=\"width: 582px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>接口名称：app.upload.icp.auth.letter</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>access_key</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"582\" style=\"width: 582px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>申请API传包服务成功后vivo开放平台分配开发者接入的accessKey。</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://dev.vivo.com.cn/documentCenter/doc/326\">具体获取说明</a>&nbsp;</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>timestamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"582\" style=\"width: 582px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>时间戳（毫秒）示例：1567945333425，允许客户端请求最大时间误差为20分钟。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>format</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>否</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"582\" style=\"width: 582px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>响应格式。默认值：json。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>v</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>String</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"125\" style=\"width: 125px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>是</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"582\" style=\"width: 582px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>API协议版本，可选值：1.0。</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"175\" style=\"width: 175px\" data-type=\"tableCell\"><p>sign_method</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"133\" style=\"width: 133px\" 